{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/2pt6umqrza30fwrmvmhs05encml3q9i.mp3","text":"做助理的话，我可以在旁边做些手工吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/mp47pnewjbadex3hyh41g10arjjh757.mp3","text":"博士，如果你喜欢追求刺激，可以去叙拉古生活一段时间。然后你就会不喜欢了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/2ios8ecsf9d71t9udr9zzh0ccx2phss.mp3","text":"贾维的性格，有时候连我都怀疑，他究竟是怎么活到今天没有被人打死的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/pzukrs9w3730ypbhwxo2wc2fivv0dgn.mp3","text":"博士，你对DIY感兴趣吗？其实，我们三个的武器和衣服，都是自己设计和制作的。如果你也喜欢的话，我们可以交流一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/a8qv11ri52qzidzgo90a9l5nzxz4erx.mp3","text":"在帮贾维擦屁股的过程中，我发现了一件事，那就是——想要真正变得强大，光靠暴力是不够的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/21ia65emgsauix0jw9qqesrnr18nr4a.mp3","text":"在叙拉古，许多同龄人都想成为一个家族的一员，但也有许多脚踏实地生活的人。我有时候，觉得他们比我们更厉害。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/40k8vlynf5t9r2wu5drrjgyfgzma2n0.mp3","text":"（哈欠声）......不好意思，博士，我昨晚没有睡好。罗德岛太安全了，我不是很习惯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/2ll54prjkxbxb71n1x3bdjd8opmaf28.mp3","text":"贾维、布洛卡、我，我们三个是伙伴，也在一起做了不少事。但我有时候也会想，这样的生活，真的就是适合我们的生活吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/82bnp2wjmzugra9is3ciczs2i1me7p2.mp3","text":"其实，我小时候的梦想是成为一名公务员，直到父亲第一次让我拿起武器。我并不讨厌和他们四处闯荡的生活，但始终感觉缺少了一些什么，现在我知道了，我想成为博士你这样内心强大的人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/p141xymmfj6m98iv3ntmu37r584pbf4.mp3","text":"博士......睡着了吗，真是个幸福的家伙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/scp952pa5qyqbuq2bxfte7iyg1qydto.mp3","text":"博士，你好。我叫奥斯塔。之前承蒙照顾，我们三个人才没有被干掉。不嫌弃的话，请让我们在这里工作一段时间吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/d1rbaqm3wgzkb3wqx55xz00l2hdlf4d.mp3","text":"......看来，我们三个能活到今天，真的只是运气比较好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/nv8g3fd4fq31qyq0zbzxiuhxpylig9u.mp3","text":"博士，罗德岛真的是一家医药公司吗？我感觉，这里的人一起出动的话，说不定可以拿下叙拉古一座城。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/ld3f8crd99qmsxou74c9qvhhqlpf9oj.mp3","text":"在罗德岛，或许我能找到一直以来我在追求的生活方式......博士，我能在舰内开一家DIY店吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/57zs9dz90qo9jqnnqgsrehpimjgpezo.mp3","text":"但愿不会是很麻烦的事情。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/s647bknh2dl40iy9g7vb4y18lbv5piv.mp3","text":"我尽力吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/15wjjojdyxgio7voltdfs0jtijwen7r.mp3","text":"尽量避免没必要的战斗吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/c9px5a4z63yg3dm5wzxq79w17glh197.mp3","text":"没办法，快点解决吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/rwnvubr3wuzo7n6gpq6xdecoviemoae.mp3","text":"我去吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/azvyagpcc1ou7kn88blzs7hbwibcao9.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/1ek48743jiwdhhtnwttkt44ogpserw4.mp3","text":"全都要解决掉吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/bis0h80hf4luxaizr5ni8fn4pwdogkx.mp3","text":"让我来试一试吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/cuuvuvh4arxpo5hh2s2w00c4aqjldn9.mp3","text":"你好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/t9f0fglqaqr03bvh2dq0j4cw2t7vykp.mp3","text":"再见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/eqm866nrno2ku88fd2fej4s0rjlhmb5.mp3","text":"该结束了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/t1keu56qpf7i41kwy2mmin693tet9og.mp3","text":"啧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/0hzmfhqpwdrtmzn7p61dxzwcrq3n0an.mp3","text":"呼、呼......博士，挑战极限是你的乐趣之一吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/ncdwzw9l926f34y9wuzxhmb8rdj3ke5.mp3","text":"全吃下了，但愿这些人有让我们这么做的价值。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/pb4ukvwt4ngpsmagg4ti27ocqamgqbe.mp3","text":"跑了几个，不过问题应该不大。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/mmgy1kfc5gh13gec0osanxvgvy421h3.mp3","text":"博士，你先走，我来殿后，这种事我擅长。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/f2657ymd8bmhxdqaie21q5q5xkpzz35.mp3","text":"那我随便走走吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/6vmzdps3fsafdukeqqu62h0aex49pd6.mp3","text":"我自己有脚，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/b8npcelaz4kcnfz3etydy6za6txvzih.mp3","text":"博士，你好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/3lednpb4uj4s9ek0th088v1s8aofbjt.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/6n8mkkjg8gp16rwtikd07f1emqyoby3.mp3","text":"以前的新年，都是我们三个人躲在小屋子里，搞一桌东西，随便吃点就过去了。像这么丰富的新年活动，我还真的没有想过......放心吧，博士，我会看着贾维，让他少惹点麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/0k78aiv64abqqiikedis2b2c7ikjkrk.mp3","text":"你好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_346_aosta/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/bsztmlt3twd8adpykakg7shxfcuhnno.mp3","text":"做助理的话，我可以在旁边做些手工吗？","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/q5pezwqzx56k3zkms70wscvdh2rcctz.mp3","text":"博士，如果你喜欢追求刺激，可以去叙拉古生活一段时间。然后你就会不喜欢了。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/3g0dghma9r76vw5g7qnzeoymn7kcu9u.mp3","text":"贾维的性格，有时候连我都怀疑，他究竟是怎么活到今天没有被人打死的。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/7s1d9pdqubd2n4hc4oodw1sm5tlvsna.mp3","text":"博士，你对DIY感兴趣吗？其实，我们三个的武器和衣服，都是自己设计和制作的。如果你也喜欢的话，我们可以交流一下。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/fvizk9nw8gvitd8kunxirpwbt4y9iq9.mp3","text":"在帮贾维擦屁股的过程中，我发现了一件事，那就是——想要真正变得强大，光靠暴力是不够的。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/gnqqg41gkwrp0vdq5uaoxcwdj1pnyvq.mp3","text":"在叙拉古，许多同龄人都想成为一个家族的一员，但也有许多脚踏实地生活的人。我有时候，觉得他们比我们更厉害。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/hlitogowe8idoe9gz616q6n3bql3b6x.mp3","text":"（哈欠声）......不好意思，博士，我昨晚没有睡好。罗德岛太安全了，我不是很习惯。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/qbjj4697ruvkc6zprqnvwuwp16wsiw1.mp3","text":"贾维、布洛卡、我，我们三个是伙伴，也在一起做了不少事。但我有时候也会想，这样的生活，真的就是适合我们的生活吗？","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/03/3n2hvdxwktqs9yns31w8mjvzmzfso1n.mp3","text":"其实，我小时候的梦想是成为一名公务员，直到父亲第一次让我拿起武器。我并不讨厌和他们四处闯荡的生活，但始终感觉缺少了一些什么，现在我知道了，我想成为博士你这样内心强大的人。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/66735ulqrgpzdon1a4brw04hxerdxsz.mp3","text":"博士......睡着了吗，真是个幸福的家伙。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/qddg1bqw5unglso5u8ht7x8062t9gj4.mp3","text":"博士，你好。我叫奥斯塔。之前承蒙照顾，我们三个人才没有被干掉。不嫌弃的话，请让我们在这里工作一段时间吧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/erhd3tijdbld7qfsbmt6hjfeezugui1.mp3","text":"......看来，我们三个能活到今天，真的只是运气比较好。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/kcz54p4kavl4v74nt602b8hlcxujhkq.mp3","text":"博士，罗德岛真的是一家医药公司吗？我感觉，这里的人一起出动的话，说不定可以拿下叙拉古一座城。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/mh32oqur4aogrcqb3qnkhlcb8bd1j3s.mp3","text":"在罗德岛，或许我能找到一直以来我在追求的生活方式......博士，我能在舰内开一家DIY店吗？","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/t83jzbfwfbk8t2tdxs5n70lz3xdudi8.mp3","text":"但愿不会是很麻烦的事情。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/8we26bkhh7ioykwytzg0oybiq7163no.mp3","text":"我尽力吧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/61yrexpocb78a63xnd12sqzng7dp133.mp3","text":"尽量避免没必要的战斗吧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/nk8kdpp0iff4sf7ba4js6i6v5vjlm45.mp3","text":"没办法，快点解决吧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/9ulzc0d8eku33mxjnbkvtfckjxino27.mp3","text":"我去吧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/kjviu4soxk6s17vjg82jaosq4kor28n.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/7wbwqwxucvoqmjy1btfhzjiwiuwujq0.mp3","text":"全都要解决掉吗？","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/41/m0rv8vmnl136gii0w6bfyzsk612vx9b.mp3","text":"让我来试一试吧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/802u57tnd66d7dn0fh4yinnscjh07zo.mp3","text":"你好。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/39/4sx89fwkk7g3hh0ssbindmgc7v4cdyw.mp3","text":"再见。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/30/2rjzsvhlh4yks1fs82z02cct00cx2jx.mp3","text":"该结束了。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/dbzw5koel0g2hthfkprvr7hyyc9sc5h.mp3","text":"啧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/lnw710c9670193ovws9cpxp6gb78l16.mp3","text":"呼、呼......博士，挑战极限是你的乐趣之一吗？","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/nh8fnaptnj0xzvtwsjl7otcxm9xqpol.mp3","text":"全吃下了，但愿这些人有让我们这么做的价值。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/5h9pwva2pwl9whcf1vkp8ogq9yxmull.mp3","text":"跑了几个，不过问题应该不大。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/dyis41xsmjuw7t147jjadjeqekrapku.mp3","text":"博士，你先走，我来殿后，这种事我擅长。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/eh2bfumqcgg09ksxfebty8pnmihctoc.mp3","text":"那我随便走走吧。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/176969c8qpflwlu0dda18l0kevpcvuy.mp3","text":"我自己有脚，博士。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/c78dd710q62m03ls9uxew8shmw1ncax.mp3","text":"博士，你好。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/1gekuof2aid1xizq4ee4bq1brm19fnq.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/4jtv2vnd4vm4qqsuk8keuqxtwm22qxp.mp3","text":"以前的新年，都是我们三个人躲在小屋子里，搞一桌东西，随便吃点就过去了。像这么丰富的新年活动，我还真的没有想过......放心吧，博士，我会看着贾维，让他少惹点麻烦。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/qsgmnh0yolwvc9qemfigi6orl11dvsb.mp3","text":"你好，博士。","alt":"voice/char_346_aosta/cn_042.mp3"}]}}